Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:09:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] buildsystem: allow extra modules to be left out of libvlc

VLC_MODULE_BLACKLIST_EXTRA is appended to the module blacklist, so a
build can drop the modules it does not need without patching the list.
---
 buildsystem/build-libvlc.sh | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/buildsystem/build-libvlc.sh b/buildsystem/build-libvlc.sh
index 382e9cf..a20a031 100755
--- a/buildsystem/build-libvlc.sh
+++ b/buildsystem/build-libvlc.sh
@@ -430,6 +430,7 @@ VLC_MODULE_BLACKLIST="
     wall
     yuv
     .dummy
+    ${VLC_MODULE_BLACKLIST_EXTRA}
 "
 
